<section class="hero" id="home">
<span class="tag">YOUR TRUSTED SOLAR SERVICE PARTNER</span>
<h1>Power Your Future With Solar Energy</h1>
<p>Solar panel, inverter, battery aur maintenance se judi samasyaon ke liye NSL Enterprises se sampark karein. Aapki complaint hamare liye mahatvapurn hai.</p>
<a href="#complaint" class="btn">Register Complaint</a>
<a href="https://wa.me/918700784156" class="btn blue">WhatsApp Us</a>
</section>

<section class="container" id="services">
<div class="heading">
<h2>Our Services</h2>
<p>Solar system ke liye professional service aur customer support.</p>
</div>
<div class="cards">
<div class="card">
<div class="symbol">☀️</div>
<h3>Solar Panel</h3>
<p>Solar panel inspection, cleaning aur performance se judi service.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="symbol">⚡</div>
<h3>Inverter Service</h3>
<p>Inverter ki working, charging aur technical problems ke liye support.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="symbol">🔋</div>
<h3>Battery Support</h3>
<p>Battery backup, charging aur battery maintenance assistance.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="symbol">🛠️</div>
<h3>Installation & Repair</h3>
<p>Solar installation, wiring aur repair se judi customer assistance.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="container" id="complaint">
<div class="heading">
<h2>Customer Complaint Portal</h2>
<p>Apni details bharein. Hamari team se WhatsApp par sampark karein.</p>
</div>
<div class="form-section">
<form id="complaintForm">
<div class="form-grid">
<div>
<label>Customer Name *</label>
<input id="customer" required placeholder="Apna naam">
</div>
<div>
<label>Mobile Number *</label>
<input id="mobile" type="tel" required pattern="[0-9+ -]{10,15}" placeholder="Mobile number">
</div>
<div>
<label>Village / City *</label>
<input id="city" required placeholder="Gaon ya shehar">
</div>
<div>
<label>Address</label>
<input id="address" placeholder="Poora pata">
</div>
</div>

<label>Solar Product</label>
<select id="product">
<option>Solar Panel</option>
<option>Inverter</option>
<option>Battery</option>
<option>Solar Wiring</option>
<option>Complete Solar System</option>
<option>Other</option>
</select>

<label>Complaint Type (Multiple select kar sakte hain)</label>
<div class="problem-list">
<label><input type="checkbox" name="problem" value="Panel not working">Panel not working</label>
<label><input type="checkbox" name="problem" value="Low power generation">Low power generation</label>
<label><input type="checkbox" name="problem" value="Inverter problem">Inverter problem</label>
<label><input type="checkbox" name="problem" value="Battery problem">Battery problem</label>
<label><input type="checkbox" name="problem" value="Wiring problem">Wiring problem</label>
<label><input type="checkbox" name="problem" value="Installation issue">Installation issue</label>
<label><input type="checkbox" name="problem" value="Cleaning required">Cleaning required</label>
<label><input type="checkbox" name="problem" value="Other">Other problem</label>
</div>

<label>Complaint Details</label>
<textarea id="details" placeholder="Apni problem detail mein likhein..."></textarea>

<button class="submit" type="submit">Submit Complaint on WhatsApp →</button>
<p style="font-size:12px;color:#64748b;margin-top:12px">Submit karne par WhatsApp khulega. Message bhejne ke liye WhatsApp mein Send dabana hoga.</p>
</form>
</div>
</section>

<section class="container" id="contact">
<div class="contact">
